# decision-engine needs NO credentials, API keys, or secrets to run —
# locally or deployed. lib/ (the decision engine itself) is deterministic,
# framework-free, and reads no external service; see lib/contracts and
# lib/cost-model. That absence is itself checked at .genesis/PLAN.md M2 and
# asserted by /api/health, rather than assumed.
#
# The one environment variable the deployed app reads is set FOR you by
# Vercel — you never configure it yourself, and local dev works without it:
#
#   VERCEL_GIT_COMMIT_SHA   The SHA of the commit Vercel deployed. Read by
#                           app/api/health/route.ts to report which commit
#                           is live. Unset during `npm run dev`; the health
#                           check falls back to "unknown (local dev)" and
#                           still runs normally.
#
# There is nothing to fill in below. If a later milestone introduces a
# real credential, it gets documented here with what it's for when that
# happens — not invented ahead of time.
